WEBVTT

00:35.970 --> 00:38.180
I-I'm very sorry.

00:40.020 --> 00:41.010
It's fine.

00:41.780 --> 00:43.970
More importantly, are you hurt?

00:49.890 --> 00:51.640
Thank you.

00:55.650 --> 01:00.180
You seem to be in a hurry, but where 
are you going this late at night?

01:00.610 --> 01:03.260
My siblings are waiting 
at home for my return.

01:04.300 --> 01:06.370
They must be starving.

01:07.870 --> 01:11.330
I see. You should hurry up, then.

01:12.710 --> 01:17.340
However, it's not safe for you 
to be out and about at night.

01:18.000 --> 01:20.810
You might get involved 
in unexpected trouble.

01:30.470 --> 01:32.880
Trouble like this.

01:35.790 --> 01:38.550
You'd better be careful.

01:48.450 --> 01:49.660
Should I kill him?

01:50.250 --> 01:51.680
Leave him be.

02:33.840 --> 02:41.010
<i>Fate is always more heroic than any story</i>

02:43.380 --> 02:50.160
<i>The one and only despair flaunts 
a completely different sky</i>

02:50.160 --> 02:52.730
<i>A stolen smile</i>

02:52.730 --> 03:02.110
<i>Put a period on the nights 
of lament and depression</i>

03:02.110 --> 03:06.740
<i>When the season comes around 
for the second time, gear yourself up</i>

03:06.740 --> 03:11.160
<i>For the final challenge</i>

03:11.160 --> 03:14.590
<i>Why don't we struggle, cry, and bloom away?</i>

03:14.590 --> 03:20.790
<i>I have a future, a future I want to 
go back to no matter what it takes</i>

03:20.790 --> 03:24.130
<i>Here we go and embrace 
the next life, nice to meet you</i>

03:24.130 --> 03:31.180
<i>There's a world, a world 
I want to repaint with you</i>

03:31.180 --> 03:33.510
<i>Let's go see the end together</i>

03:33.510 --> 03:36.150
<i>The ending credits signal the beginning</i>

03:36.150 --> 03:40.990
<i>A special story drawn by light and shadow</i>

03:40.990 --> 03:43.320
<i>Ge ge ge ge ge get back</i>

03:43.320 --> 03:45.950
<i>To my own story</i>

03:51.040 --> 03:55.460
<b></b>Episode 11

03:51.040 --> 03:55.460
<b>  A Raid</b>

04:20.690 --> 04:21.900
Let's begin.

04:53.370 --> 04:54.270
Fire.

05:10.780 --> 05:13.170
As expected of the Magical Tower.

05:13.810 --> 05:16.890
The strength of their Defense Magic 
is nearly unparalleled.

05:17.630 --> 05:18.680
However...

05:26.880 --> 05:31.420
It cannot defend against 
two types of attack at once.

05:42.940 --> 05:43.910
Continue!

06:14.020 --> 06:15.440
Intruders!

06:15.440 --> 06:16.530
Fight back!

06:16.530 --> 06:18.150
Do not let them in!

06:28.610 --> 06:32.700
Good grief. Must you be so noisy?

06:41.400 --> 06:42.470
Go.

06:45.250 --> 06:46.090
Fire!

07:04.560 --> 07:05.840
Master Kraiken.

07:05.840 --> 07:08.090
Yes. Let's go.

07:09.970 --> 07:11.510
Invisible.

07:23.330 --> 07:24.410
They really are here!

07:24.410 --> 07:26.070
All of you, go downstairs!

07:37.680 --> 07:39.810
What a stupid lot.

07:47.770 --> 07:49.530
However...

07:53.980 --> 07:56.830
<i>The readiness of the security guards...</i>

07:57.540 --> 07:59.420
They really are here!

08:00.410 --> 08:02.410
<i>Their reaction...</i>

08:04.960 --> 08:06.140
Right here, sir.

08:06.490 --> 08:07.490
Good.

08:50.650 --> 08:51.720
Get back.

09:07.730 --> 09:09.820
Earth Rage!

09:34.450 --> 09:35.510
So this is...

09:36.640 --> 09:40.510
The high-rank magic gem,
 the Tear of Regernel!

09:42.780 --> 09:45.480
Stop right there, Outers.

09:50.640 --> 09:52.180
I need you to surrender.

09:52.710 --> 09:53.790
A child?

09:53.790 --> 09:55.200
Why is he here?

10:00.300 --> 10:02.120
Let me ask you something.

10:03.160 --> 10:04.420
"Outers"...

10:04.420 --> 10:08.530
How did you... learn our name?

10:10.250 --> 10:12.800
<i>This man... he's strong!</i>

10:14.000 --> 10:15.320
Answer me.

10:18.420 --> 10:19.600
Kill him.

10:19.600 --> 10:20.220
Sir.

10:20.870 --> 10:22.890
Wave of Flame!

10:34.070 --> 10:35.440
Oh?

10:37.540 --> 10:39.030
<i>Two swordsmen.</i>

10:40.540 --> 10:42.480
<i>Four mages.</i>

10:43.600 --> 10:45.870
<i>Their Circle is about the same as Romantica's.</i>

10:46.420 --> 10:47.670
Ice Spear!

10:47.670 --> 10:48.710
Fireball!

10:52.180 --> 10:53.460
What?!

10:53.790 --> 10:54.790
Get back!

10:54.790 --> 10:56.760
Mages are at disadvantage!

10:56.760 --> 10:57.760
Too slow!

11:04.660 --> 11:05.810
Entangle.

11:16.940 --> 11:18.490
Doom Fist!

11:28.580 --> 11:30.380
Nice moves.

11:30.380 --> 11:33.510
But you seem to be lacking experience.

11:35.600 --> 11:36.860
Bind!

11:39.200 --> 11:42.890
Do you really think I can't 
handle speed like that?!

11:53.070 --> 11:56.990
Didn't I tell you? 
You don't have enough experience.

11:58.210 --> 12:01.450
From the look of it, you are a 
student at Hebrion Academy.

12:02.260 --> 12:05.200
Use this experience in the next battle.

12:05.750 --> 12:08.000
If there is a next battle, that is.

12:22.930 --> 12:23.890
What?!

12:23.890 --> 12:24.880
Watch out!

12:24.880 --> 12:26.390
There are more on his side?

12:33.400 --> 12:34.480
Master Kraiken!

12:44.220 --> 12:46.730
<i>It's not strong enough 
to penetrate the armor.</i>

13:01.430 --> 13:03.370
<i>But its accuracy and speed...</i>

13:03.900 --> 13:05.850
<i>As well as the volume of it...</i>

13:06.870 --> 13:08.310
<i>Multiple casters?</i>

13:08.700 --> 13:10.160
<i>What is going on?!</i>

13:10.600 --> 13:12.650
<i>The readiness of the security guards,</i>

13:13.160 --> 13:15.900
<i>the skilled guards that 
are well placed on this spot...</i>

13:16.610 --> 13:18.400
<i>Something doesn't add up.</i>

13:22.450 --> 13:25.170
<i>No, I can't lose sight of what I'm here for!</i>

13:26.200 --> 13:28.320
All of you, protect me!

13:28.320 --> 13:29.380
Yes, sir!

13:41.940 --> 13:43.140
Goodbye.

13:43.140 --> 13:44.300
You're not getting away!

13:47.680 --> 13:49.400
Don't get in my way!

14:05.010 --> 14:08.150
Get blown away by Master Kraiken's magic!

14:25.560 --> 14:27.300
You can't escape!

14:39.350 --> 14:41.920
Master Kraiken?!

14:45.390 --> 14:47.380
I thought he was on your side!

14:48.640 --> 14:51.370
There's plenty more where he came from.

14:51.950 --> 14:53.490
You're awful.

15:01.540 --> 15:03.510
Nice swordsmanship.

15:03.510 --> 15:05.130
But it's pointless!

15:16.850 --> 15:18.190
Is this...?

15:37.010 --> 15:39.330
Repeating the useless attack?

15:39.940 --> 15:43.670
That seems to be the only attack you know.

15:43.670 --> 15:45.230
And...

15:48.640 --> 15:49.820
There!

16:00.550 --> 16:02.850
I see. Just one caster...

16:03.380 --> 16:05.140
What's your point?

16:06.860 --> 16:11.460
I never expected brats 
like you to ruin my plan.

16:12.510 --> 16:14.310
Who sent you?

16:15.650 --> 16:19.620
You knew I was going to 
be here today, didn't you?

16:19.620 --> 16:20.580
How?

16:21.650 --> 16:23.460
Who told you?

16:23.890 --> 16:25.960
You think we'd tell you?

16:25.960 --> 16:32.180
You'd better confess, or you'll feel pain 
that makes you wish you were dead.

16:33.740 --> 16:36.380
What a cheap threat.

16:36.380 --> 16:38.140
I'll give you 30 points.

16:38.140 --> 16:40.490
A foolish decision.

16:54.000 --> 16:57.770
Romantica, you shouldn't make him too mad.

16:58.120 --> 17:00.820
He was just acting so arrogant.

17:01.360 --> 17:03.630
Couldn't help it!

17:08.370 --> 17:09.090
What?!

17:13.540 --> 17:17.320
Even if it's accurate, an attack that weak can't—

17:18.720 --> 17:21.140
Wh-What?!

17:22.000 --> 17:24.170
Thank you for your advice.

17:26.230 --> 17:28.290
Stop underestimating me!

17:49.090 --> 17:50.170
So close!

17:50.910 --> 17:54.100
Brats, play time is over!

17:55.890 --> 17:57.350
Pram, get back!

18:02.260 --> 18:04.650
Earth Rage.

18:47.590 --> 18:49.500
Here we go.

18:52.350 --> 18:53.730
Are you okay?

18:53.730 --> 18:54.740
Yes.

18:55.500 --> 18:57.870
We're thoroughly beaten.

18:57.870 --> 19:00.700
Yes, he was very strong.

19:01.790 --> 19:04.920
I guess we need more training!

19:05.910 --> 19:08.880
Let's ask Desir to train us!

19:14.050 --> 19:17.830
<i>Was this really okay, Desir?</i>

19:46.410 --> 19:48.490
That was unexpected.

19:48.900 --> 19:52.440
To have read our moves like this...

19:52.440 --> 19:56.260
As expected of Zod Exarion, I suppose.

19:57.190 --> 20:00.520
But the Tear of Regernel is in my hand.

20:01.290 --> 20:03.130
Victory is ours.

20:03.570 --> 20:05.980
That's too early to say.

20:06.370 --> 20:07.490
Who's there?!

20:09.750 --> 20:11.130
You are...

20:13.240 --> 20:15.250
Nice to see you again.

20:15.920 --> 20:18.910
May I ask reimbursement

20:20.530 --> 20:22.870
for the bread you stepped on earlier?

20:26.870 --> 20:29.560
How did you know where I was?

20:38.970 --> 20:40.250
Is this...?

20:42.220 --> 20:44.680
I've marked you with mana.

20:52.120 --> 20:55.480
So it was all your doing.

20:56.080 --> 20:59.610
Tonight's security detail, those brats...

20:59.610 --> 21:00.820
All of it.

21:10.400 --> 21:11.510
Excellent!

21:11.510 --> 21:14.360
Such skill for someone so young!

21:18.390 --> 21:21.380
How dare you get in my way?!

21:22.310 --> 21:25.200
Doom Fist!

21:48.240 --> 21:49.110
What?!

21:50.660 --> 21:53.960
Now, I'll ask you to return...

21:59.250 --> 22:01.240
...what you've taken.

22:05.720 --> 22:08.470
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:08.470 --> 22:11.180
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:11.180 --> 22:14.790
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

22:19.270 --> 22:24.680
<i>All emotions will fade away sooner or later</i>

22:24.680 --> 22:29.280
<i>So we can pretend it's all a fairytale</i>

22:30.030 --> 22:35.400
<i>Even love is just a fleeting dream</i>

22:35.400 --> 22:39.830
<i>So let's throw the dice 
and see what's in store</i>

22:40.180 --> 22:46.350
<i>I rolled a six today, eight times in a row</i>

22:46.350 --> 22:51.610
<i>But who knows what 
tomorrow's play will bring?</i>

22:51.610 --> 22:56.640
<i>I hope one day we'll be able to say</i>

22:56.640 --> 23:00.850
<i>That not knowing was the best part</i>

23:02.360 --> 23:05.130
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

23:05.130 --> 23:07.820
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

23:07.820 --> 23:11.330
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

23:13.200 --> 23:16.040
<i>If we happen to meet again in the next life</i>

23:16.040 --> 23:18.620
<i>I'll take any help I can get, 
even my own cat's</i>

23:18.620 --> 23:21.330
<i>Because this time</i>

23:21.330 --> 23:25.460
<i>I'll roll a three</i>

23:35.480 --> 23:39.980
<b></b>Episode 12

23:35.480 --> 23:39.980
<b>  Anti-Mage</b>

23:36.230 --> 23:38.980
Next episode, "Anti-Mage."
